            "detailed_description": "<h1>JUNTA-TE AO DISCORD!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/bbde7e1d0bdfa77e1279d4307c35ae94.avif?t=1667223602\" width=630 height=151 /></span><br><br>Positron X é um fps rogue-lite futurista repleto de combates frenéticos, movimentos criativos, visuais incríveis e a possibilidade de controlar o tempo! Cada partida será uma experiência única.<br><br><strong>Luta contra INÚMERAS MÁQUINAS geradas aleatoriamente num jogo de tiros frenético clássico.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/ec5a8a1f53d41dd0a2d1234a7596ce11.avif?t=1667223602\" width=630 height=151 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sensação de tiros na primeira pessoa incomparável e movimentos fluidos<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/ab696bc2cc3de3f096c27796a8f7c915.poster.avif?t=1667223602\" width=642 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/ab696bc2cc3de3f096c27796a8f7c915.webm?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/ab696bc2cc3de3f096c27796a8f7c915.mp4?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Habilidades de manipulação do tempo alucinantes<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/a1c78d2dfd8f492f308d90c55507abd9.poster.avif?t=1667223602\" width=642 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/a1c78d2dfd8f492f308d90c55507abd9.webm?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/a1c78d2dfd8f492f308d90c55507abd9.mp4?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Uma campanha rogue-lite em constante mudança repleta de ação<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/adbf4cf893c322c072684bdbc595513f.poster.avif?t=1667223602\" width=642 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/adbf4cf893c322c072684bdbc595513f.webm?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/adbf4cf893c322c072684bdbc595513f.mp4?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Várias armas e dezenas de Impressões e Implantes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/c76dc3891f95249901f6a7bf4bb54882.poster.avif?t=1667223602\" width=642 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/c76dc3891f95249901f6a7bf4bb54882.webm?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/c76dc3891f95249901f6a7bf4bb54882.mp4?t=1667223602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/529970/extras/3e5f1075d22377703e245400f8df5abc.avif?t=1667223602\" width=630 height=151 /></span><br><br><strong>Num futuro próximo, o nosso sol está a morrer.<br>A humanidade está à beira da extinção.</strong><br><br>A última esperança de sobrevivência é abandonar a Terra, viajar para um planeta distante do qual pouco se sabe e torná-lo no novo lar da humanidade. Como nenhum humano consegue sobreviver à viagem, o sucesso da missão está nas mãos de Turing, uma inteligência artificial autónoma. Mas nem tudo corre como previsto, quando algo desperta das profundezas...",
